 space, but as Aaron Short reported for Hyperallergic , "bits of masking tape were still stuck to the stairway railings, and a handful of missing wall panels revealed internal wires, rebar, and insulation." WangShui's work is included in the inaugural exhibition New Humans: Memories of the Future , which explores what it means to be human amid the cataclysmic technological changes of the 20th and 21st centuries through the work of more than 150 artists. The new building received mixed reviews from Hyperallergic 's critics with Editor-at-Large Hrag Vartanian calling it a "mishmash of Obama-era startup culture, dated by the lime green and perforated metal."ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;AJGdmJSMhUp-srU-GCmSEZ0xX2unG3NYW6luRctMgXwƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9New Museum's Shiny New Building Leaks During Flash Floodsƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;fWiGc5L7RtNgxRxyviPDoO-G9tyLf8fgV0r2pdMrQykƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkoSyndicationItemƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;uP7zD-1P-NR3SVl3WVhyTUdwXtMYTjZ8vW2iznn4BjYƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxShttps://hyperallergic.com/new-museums-shiny-new-building-leaks-during-flash-floods/ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;R3C7xXTSYuP9B_lFS9lTfQKqurmG5-g4f3xe2rdvXfAƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9new-museum-s-shiny-new-building-leaks-during-flash-floodsƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;1krvltUNgwE_UDrPLTLDcoWSvxGQ9GUliYHKazscCY0ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkwSyndicationSourceBundleƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;P9hmTqzVINDVg_cf8c0BWFTgeB0KW8M9xglyBQ8OWwYƒdpairƒerightdunitƒeright